better
<br>than those above.
<p>In closing, it would be hard to better the conclusion of another Paul
DeMone
<br>article from 18 months ago - watch out for URL line-wrap
<br>( <a href="http://www.realworldtech.com/page.cfm?section=columns&AID=RWT062000000000&">http://www.realworldtech.com/page.cfm?section=columns&amp;AID=RWT062000000000&amp;</a>
<br>p=9 ):
<p>"It is tempting to see an active period of fierce competition and change
